OL,3,GNEWSAHalloween fans warned over
OL,4,Aapparent scarefest scam
OL,5,
OL,6,FVenues across the UK have issued a
OL,7,Fwarning to Halloween fans after tickets
OL,8,Fto "scarefest" events were sold in an
OL,9,Fapparent scam.
OL,11,FHalloween Nights Fear, the company
OL,12,Fbehind the sales, has listed nine
OL,13,Fevents across England, Scotland and
OL,14,FWales, despite three hosts confirming
OL,15,Fthe listings are fake.
OL,17,FTickets for the events, scheduled from
OL,18,F20 October until 1 November, range from
OL,19,F#14 to #140.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
